---
name: build-apk
description: Build local del APK Android (Gradle, sin EAS)
mode: write
---

Construye el APK release del proyecto en local usando Gradle. Pide confirmación antes de eliminar `C:\erp` y el cache de Gradle.

## Pasos

Ejecuta en PowerShell, paso a paso. Si algún paso falla, **detente** y reporta el error sin continuar.

```powershell
# 1. Variables
$PROJECT = "C:/Users/Aaron/IdeaProjects/admin-frontend-joanis/admin-frontend-joanis"
$BUILD_DIR = "C:\erp"
$OUTPUT_DIR = "C:\Users\Aaron\OneDrive\Desktop\apps Erp aio"

$env:JAVA_HOME = "C:\Program Files\Android\Android Studio\jbr"
$env:ANDROID_HOME = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Android\Sdk"
$env:GRADLE_USER_HOME = "C:\gradle_cache"
$env:GRADLE_OPTS = "-Xmx4g -XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=1g"

# 2. Versión desde app.json
$VERSION = (Get-Content "$PROJECT\app.json" | ConvertFrom-Json).expo.version

# 3. Limpieza
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force $BUILD_DIR -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force "C:\gradle_cache" -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path "C:\gradle_cache" -Force | Out-Null

# 4. Copia con robocopy (evita paths largos)
robocopy $PROJECT $BUILD_DIR /E /XD node_modules android .git /NFL /NDL /NJH /NJS /NC /NS /NP

# 5. Dependencias
Set-Location $BUILD_DIR
npm install

# 6. Prebuild Android
npx expo prebuild --platform android --clean

# 7. local.properties
"sdk.dir=$($env:ANDROID_HOME -replace '\\', '/')" | Out-File -FilePath "$BUILD_DIR\android\local.properties" -Encoding UTF8

# 8. Build Gradle (solo arm64-v8a)
Set-Location "$BUILD_DIR\android"
./gradlew assembleRelease -PreactNativeArchitectures=arm64-v8a --no-daemon

# 9. Copiar APK
$APK_SOURCE = "$BUILD_DIR\android\app\build\outputs\apk\release\app-release.apk"
Copy-Item $APK_SOURCE "$OUTPUT_DIR\ERP-aio-v$VERSION.apk" -Force

Set-Location $PROJECT
```

## Requisitos previos
- Java 21 (Android Studio JBR), Android SDK en `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Android\Sdk`.
- **No** usar Java 25 (incompatible).

## Notas
- Tiempo estimado: 5–10 min la primera vez.
- Tamaño APK esperado: ~80–120 MB.
- Output: `C:\Users\Aaron\OneDrive\Desktop\apps Erp aio\ERP-aio-v{VERSION}.apk`.
